  <title>7.16.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02028</md:content-id>
    <md:title>7.16.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>1a104c76-bf94-4793-b7cb-ac15c30f2c8d</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">The equation of a quadratic function is \(y=(x-1)^2+5\) and the point \((3,9)\) also lies on the parabola. What is another point that lies on the parabola?</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
